{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはりんごっっ(o・・o)\nさゆりんごっっ(o・・o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は思い悩むことが多い松村です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京とは何ぞや。とか\nどうでもええことを\n考える毎日、プライスレス！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京とは何ぞや。\n東京..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松村はなんで東京にでてきたんやろか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんで東京には\n色んな人が集まるんやろか？\nこの街には何があるんやろか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とうきょう\nきょうと\n似てる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はレコーディングしました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ好きな曲です♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対ライブでやったら\n盛り上がるわ〜って感じです＼(^^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく面白くて歌割りもいつもと\nちゃうから\nどんな仕上がりになるか楽しみなんっ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ〜はやく皆さんに聞いてほしいわ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"た〜ら〜ら〜ら〜\nちゃらちゃらっちゃららら〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って感じの曲です！！\n伝われー＼(^^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっき友達から電話かかってきてて\n嬉しくてかけ直したら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「かけ間違えた。」の一言で終わった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなしきかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さよならりんごっっ(o・・o)/\nさゆりんごっっ(o・・o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2013/02/07/4095955/0000.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}